{"ticker":"CRWD","updated":"2026-10-30T22:42:20Z","profile":{"longName":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.crowdstrike.com","fullTimeEmployees":11706,"marketCap":256424001536,"trailingPE":4173.8335,"forwardPE":155.42784,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":47.519848,"pegRatio":6.74,"targetMeanPrice":247.25,"targetHighPrice":325.0,"targetLowPrice":132.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":50,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.258,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.75185996,"operatingMargins":-0.02259,"profitMargins":0.00834,"totalRevenue":5396145152,"beta":1.197,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":286.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":85.68,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. provides cybersecurity solutions in the United States and internationally. Its unified platform provides cloud-delivered protection of endpoints, cloud workloads, identity, and data through a software as a service (SaaS) subscription-based model. The company offers corporate endpoint and cloud workload security, managed security, security and vulnerability management, IT operations management, identity protection, threat intelligence, data protection, SaaS security posture management, and AI powered workflow automation, and securing generative AI workload services, as well as security orchestration, automation, and response; and security information and event management, and log management services. It primarily sells subscriptions to its Falcon platform and cloud modules. The company has a strategic alliance with Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation to help enterprises secure artificial intelligence across its lifecycle, from the AI agents and models to the foundational infrastructure that supports the entire AI ecosystem and with Snowflake to bring AI-native security and enterprise data at scale. Additionally, it has a partnership with Fortanix Inc. to combine its Falcon platform with Fortanix Confidential AI to provide an integrated solution for end-to-end AI security. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Austin, Texas","summary_zh":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. 在美國和國際上提供網路安全解決方案。其統一平台透過基於軟體即服務 (SaaS) 訂閱的模式提供端點、雲端工作負載、身分和資料的雲端保護。該公司提供企業端點和雲端工作負載安全、託管安全、安全和漏洞管理、IT 營運管理、身分保護、威脅情報、資料保護、SaaS 安全態勢管理和人工智慧驅動的工作流程自動化，以及保護生成式人工智慧工作負載服務，以及安全編排、自動化和回應；安全資訊和事件管理以及日誌管理服務。它主要銷售其 Falcon 平台和雲端模組的訂閱。該公司與 Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation 建立了戰略聯盟，幫助企業在整個生命週期中保護人工智慧的安全，從 AI 代理和模型到支援整個 AI 生態系統的基礎設施，並與 Snowflake 合作以大規模提供 AI 原生安全和企業資料。此外，它還與 Fortanix Inc. 合作，將其 Falcon 平台與 Fortanix Confidential AI 結合，為端對端 AI 安全提供整合解決方案。該公司成立於2011年，總部位於德克薩斯州奧斯汀","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":104.2773,"h":104.505,"l":101.9238,"c":103.375,"v":15051200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":103.2462,"h":103.62,"l":101.07,"c":103.3,"v":12146000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":103.3,"h":103.8725,"l":100.665,"c":103.115,"v":11053600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":103.5175,"h":104.528,"l":101.765,"c":104.4075,"v":8677200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":104.75,"h":107.2113,"l":104.105,"c":107.015,"v":10183200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":107.0425,"h":107.7517,"l":105.1575,"c":105.8775,"v":8507200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":106.8913,"h":108.4518,"l":105.5425,"c":106.2175,"v":9115200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":107.0625,"h":109.565,"l":106.775,"c":108.345,"v":9647600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":108.8475,"h":110.75,"l":108.75,"c":109.025,"v":11058800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":110.3938,"h":112.2175,"l":109.1875,"c":111.1925,"v":11517600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":111.2,"h":112.08,"l":108.7,"c":111.245,"v":11632000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":111.25,"h":113.5,"l":108.585,"c":111.375,"v":15491200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":117.2312,"h":126.055,"l":115.53,"c":125.6575,"v":40482000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":124.75,"h":126.799,"l":123.9525,"c":125.6375,"v":28371200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":124.0,"h":125.075,"l":121.5825,"c"